    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="190" width="385" height="215">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" fontFamily="Consolas" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>from metgrs import WindProfileRadar, CloudRadar</p>
        <p>fps = sorted(glob.glob("...ROBS/*.TXT"))</p>
        <p>ds = WindProfileRadar.readL3files(</p>
        <p>    fps, use_multiprocess=True)</p>
        <p>ds["U_Wind_Speed"].plot(x="time", y="height")</p>
        <p>ds_c = CloudRadar.readBaseDatas(...)</p>
        <p>ds_c.cld.plot("Z1")</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="430" width="840" height="80">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(75,85,99,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">高频坑：</span>依赖 joblib；CDWL 的 / 读入是 NaN；微波辐射计列名带中文括号、编码 gbk；L3 时间在 attrs 里。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">示例：</span>GitCode longtsing/metgrs examples 1~4（风廓线/云雷达/激光雷达/微波辐射计）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
